--TEST--
`die` is refused with `exit` named as its one replacement, and the file never runs — `rule:statements/exit-is-the-only-termination-keyword`
--FILE--
<?nvs
echo "before\n";
die("stop");
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0228]: `die` is not supported
  --> case.nvs:3:1
%A
